{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00112","headline":"立春日游苑迎春 · 中宗皇帝","name":"立春日游苑迎春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神皐福地三秦邑，玉台金阙九仙家。\n寒光犹恋甘泉树，淑景偏临建始花。\n彩蝶黄鸎未歌舞，梅香柳色已矜夸。\n迎春正啓流霞席，暂嘱曦轮勿遽斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"中宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}